1. unzip RPMC_xx.tar.gz
2. start Terminal and go to RPMC directory
3. run commands as below
   sudo sh ./run.sh --check  -n
   sudo sh ./run.sh --set 0
   sudo sh ./run.sh --set 1
   sudo sh ./run.sh --set 2
   sudo sh ./run.sh --set 3

Note: If you encounter any errors, please make sure you have permission to execute these commands. try 'sudo chmod a+x run.sh' and 'sudo chmod a+x main.out'.
